ame> <given-names>G</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Leduc</surname> <given-names>JW</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Characterization of Dobrava virus: a Hantavirus from Slovenia, Yugoslavia.</article-title><source>J Med Virol</source> <year>1992</year>;<volume>38</volume>:<fpage>132</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>7</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/jmv.1890380211</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1360999</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R10"><label>10. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Lundkvist</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Apekina</surname> <given-names>N</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Myasnikov</surname> <given-names>Y</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Vapalahti</surname> <given-names>O</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Vaheri</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Plyusnin</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Dobrava hantavirus outbreak in Russia.</article-title><source>Lancet</source> <year>1997</year>;<volume>350</volume>:<fpage>781</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>2</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(05)62565-2</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9298001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R11"><label>11. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Plyusnin</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Nemirov</surname> <given-names>K</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Apekina</surname> <given-names>N</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Plyusnina</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Lundkvist</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Vaheri</surname> <given-names>A</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Dobrava hantavirus in Russia.</article-title><source>Lancet</source> <year>1999</year>;<volume>353</volume>:<fpage>207</fpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(05)77216-0</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9923881</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R12"><label>12. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Klempa</surname> <given-names>B</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Schmidt</surname> <given-names>HA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ulrich</surname> <given-names>R</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Kaluz</surname> <given-names>S</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Labuda</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Meisel</surname> <given-names>H</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Genetic interaction between distinct Dobrava hantavirus subtypes in <italic>Apodemus agrarius</italic> and <italic>A. flavicollis</italic> in nature.</article-title><source>J Virol</source> <year>2002</year>;<volume>77</volume>:<fpage>804</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>9</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JVI.77.1.804-809.2003</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12477889</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R13"><label>13. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Klempa</surname> <given-names>B</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Schutt</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Auste</surname> <given-names>B</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Labuda</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ulrich</surname> <given-names>R</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Meisel</surname> <given-names>H</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>First molecular identification of human Dobrava virus infection in central</article-title>. <source>Eur J Clin Microbiol</source> <year>2004</year>;<volume>42</volume>:<fpage>1322</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>5</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JC